// Multi-ally ranged buff (sheet range 9m, aoe multi-target, up to ten allies). No drowning,
// suffocation, or breath-meter system exists anywhere in this engine (checked
// common/src/comp/health.rs and common/src/comp/buff.rs in full -- no Drowning/Waterlogged
// BuffKind, no breath resource). The spell's actual mechanical premise therefore has no engine
// hook to grant immunity from. FreedomOfMovement (immunity to DifficultTerrain) is used instead
// as the nearest "moves freely through an otherwise-hostile medium" primitive, echoing the
// sheet's own "moving freely between surface and depths" phrasing -- ships as a defensible
// utility buff rather than a literal no-op, but flagged clearly as a deviation from the sheet's
// stated effect, not a mechanical equivalent.
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.3,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: FreedomOfMovement,
            strength: 1.0,
            duration: Some(60.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(1.0),
    range: 9.0,
    energy_cost: 55.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Primordial), cooldown: Some(20.0)),
)
